{"id": "E000026", "payload": {"analyst": "lab", "question_id": "E000025", "text": "Two ways, and they are not the same set. Recent results - anything collected in about the last month - come over the HL7 ORU feed only. The extract table holds the history; a result from last week is in the feed and not yet in the table."}, "type": "answer"}
