{"id": "E000038", "payload": {"analyst": "interface", "text": "What timezone does FAC3 run, and how are its vitals charted?", "why": "coverage checklist"}, "type": "question"}
{"id": "E000039", "payload": {"analyst": "interface", "question_id": "E000038", "text": "FAC3 runs Mountain Time, America/Denver, and its charting is metric: kilograms, Celsius, centimetres. FAC1 and FAC2 are Central and imperial. Anyone who tells you the whole system is Central has not watched the FAC3 channel at midnight."}, "type": "answer"}
